c{\\pi }{2}-\\frac{\\pi }{7}=\\frac{5\\pi }{14}\n$$\n\n radians with the positive $x$-axis.\n\n- The line that passes through the origin and the point $Q$ forms an angle of \n\n$$\n\\pi -\\frac{\\pi }{3}=\\frac{2\\pi }{3}\n$$\n\n radians with the positive $z$-axis.\n\nTherefore, the spherical coordinates of $Q$ are $(3,\\frac{5\\pi }{14},\\frac{2\\pi }{3}).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-165340/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "28a9233c-6ff6-5ed0-b59b-e7f9807b4ffd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-165340"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-165301/selection/ebdb9bd207b68bb2be8ef8e1129223ea58d08774e3877b9ca3f53ca2bd74fd44" :answer/id #uuid "ab729ad4-5e99-5933-8bfe-d4f3a5d01265" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\sqrt{2},\\frac{\\pi }{8},\\frac{\\pi }{4})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165301/selection/4af5b81b9a9a0ac168eabe09d1a69413ca0e02b4f82329f80a49435373daf2ae" :answer/id #uuid "b1917214-948c-5b69-9881-d8f246ddcc8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\sqrt{2},\\frac{3\\pi }{8},\\frac{3\\pi }{4})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165301/selection/c63365d02bb1d79aa6a46200ed08bd8c427ccb3241934b5b54016c7731f1b807" :answer/id #uuid "d83ea85a-4b05-5f29-9f19-35bd3aed3278" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\sqrt{2},\\frac{7\\pi }{8},\\frac{3\\pi }{4})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165301/selection/9a0a75815837ea2ddca7fe7ca0bf0bfea1bf7a88cdb18c19c1e8c29944f95b87" :answer/id #uuid "8223831b-ae0e-5e7a-ae30-282cd18687f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\sqrt{2},\\frac{\\pi }{8},\\frac{3\\pi }{4})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165301/selection/8bde407df5b117a8e4a3a80ddb2f2f87ccbfd9175df95b2ae4e5590a8aa5098e" :answer/id #uuid "8950879d-635c-5419-836c-41d5d73fb7fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\sqrt{2},\\frac{3\\pi }{8},\\frac{\\pi }{4})" :db/ensure 